    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Well, there's a lot of things. First of all, it's a whole new culture, a whole new experience. Second, I happen to think you can't keep doing diplomacy at this moment in time the same old way you did it before. There's a lot more. I mean, I always took the train to work, but it's become kind of a brand, but it's a public engagement. But when I ever have visiting dignitaries from the United States, I make them do something public so you're not, America's not just seeing driving up in a black car, getting out going into office building, get back in a car and driving off. There's some way of engaging the public. Secretary Nelson from NASA",
