    "turn_idx": 36,
    "turn_text": "And there's a lot of different players, a lot of different interests, a lot of different fairs, a lot of different insecurities. You know, one of the things I've learned, never really spent time putting my head around it, Where does deterrence and provocation begin? It's not science. So forget about it. It's both intention and interpretation. And you just don't know, given all the players, all the interests, all the insecurities, all the history. where somebody's going to take somebody's deterrence as a provocation. You just don't know.",
