    "turn_text": "I think about the time I was what I called in the Senate penalty box where I was studying up on Japan before confirmation, everybody told me certain things that have different Japan, what they do, they Japan experts. Just weren't accurate. And I don't think they were probably accurate 20 years ago. It's just a whole different Japan. They're doing things under their own defense posture. Their defense budget is going to go from ninth in the world to third. They're going to be able to acquire capacities that counter strike that 10 years ago, you wouldn't have talked about. And they're doing it in five years. Things that people said we were moving incredibly slow with rapid focus, laser-like focus they're",
