    "turn_text": "Trade is a huge opportunity, but we have to make investments in people so that everybody has a chance of seizing those opportunities and also in their own way, mitigating their risk. And that risk is not equally shared nor the opportunities. That doesn't mean you end something and make sure you make the right kind of amelioration because the principle still has a huge opportunity.",
